mthrowback
Target RejectNegative Mask(THROWBACK)
Send errors and warnings to a text editor as well (DDEUtils throwback; a cross compiler sends it to the SysLogD of the host named by THROWBACK_HOST)

mlibscl
Target RejectNegative Negative(mmodule) InverseMask(UNIXLIB,LIBSCL)
Compile with the RISC OS SharedCLibrary headers

munixlib
Target RejectNegative Negative(mlibscl) Mask(UNIXLIB)
Compile with the RISC OS UnixLib headers (default)

mmodule
Target RejectNegative Negative(munixlib) Mask(MODULE)
Target for RISC OS modules
